0x5558448fd827ea876177c2beefc7415d539d0f5c6281745f5def259fa9002b6f  ALLOWLIST.md

keccak256 of ALLOWLIST.md's bytes, 14479 of them. Reproduce it with:

    cast keccak "0x$(xxd -p < ALLOWLIST.md | tr -d '\n')"

This value is what goes on chain, in a zero-value transaction from the deployer
before UnderwaterWaitlist is deployed — see the Publication section of the document
itself. It lives here rather than inside ALLOWLIST.md because a file cannot state
its own hash.

Amending the criteria before registration opens means: edit the document, recompute
this value, publish a new transaction, and re-pin CRITERIA_URL in
web/components/WaitlistPanel.tsx to the commit carrying the new bytes. After
registration opens the document is final.

NOT YET PUBLISHED. The waitlist deploy 0x90a1620578CE419242F806e7387Db7e70c8cfa96
on Ink Sepolia predates this document, so no transaction commits this hash yet.
